WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.485
- You look so sharp, man.

00:00:01.485 --> 00:00:02.318
- Oh, you know.

00:00:02.318 --> 00:00:03.151
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:00:03.151 --> 00:00:04.278
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:00:04.278 --> 00:00:07.138
Is this what Emmy winners look like?

00:00:07.138 --> 00:00:08.360
Is that what's happening?

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.449
- Oh you know what.

00:00:09.449 --> 00:00:12.411
I still have my Emmy glow,
I feel like, you know?.

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:13.244
- I love that.

00:00:13.244 --> 00:00:14.210
- Yeah.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.118
- Especially when it's
unexpected, you know.

00:00:16.118 --> 00:00:16.951
- Yeah

00:00:16.951 --> 00:00:20.420
You know, you go there,
of course I presented

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.790
the first award of the evening.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.110
I had a little monologue.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:24.430
So, you know, being a performer,

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.290
being someone who loves
what he does, you know,

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:30.040
I went out there and my mind is mainly on

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:33.360
how do we kick this show
off the best way possible.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.820
I'm first up, I got to
do a little monologue.

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.830
I'm presenting the first award.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.580
My mind is on making sure I do a good job

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.000
and making sure people have a great time.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:41.833
- Yeah.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:44.250
- You know, what they
brung me there to do.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.990
Of course, I hate to say that
the Emmy was second place,

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:49.160
but the Emmy is a nomination.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.400
I don't know if I won yet.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.233
You know what I mean?

00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:52.950
So my thing is, initially
the show's great.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.890
I sat down in my seat,

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.390
watch the rest of the show.

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:59.550
Halfway through the show, my
buddy turns around and says,

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:01.880
did you write a speech in case you win?

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:03.371
I said, no, I did not.

00:01:03.371 --> 00:01:04.613
(audience laughing)

00:01:04.613 --> 00:01:07.290
- That's when I win things.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:08.220
I'm not prepared.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:09.053
- You're not prepared for it.

00:01:09.053 --> 00:01:10.274
- Yeah, that's when it happens.

00:01:10.274 --> 00:01:11.107
- That's when it happens.

00:01:11.107 --> 00:01:12.413
- Just never be prepared.

